      "lemma": "property lemma_3; @(posedge clk) disable iff (rst) (x == -100 + c * (c - 13) / 2); endproperty",
      "explanation": "This captures the accumulated updates to x: its change on each iteration is y = c - 6. Signed decimal constants give the expression at least 32-bit arithmetic width, avoiding an 8-bit intermediate product. ([accellera.org](https://www.accellera.org/images/eda/sv-bc/11355.html?utm_source=openai))"
    },
