      "lemma": "property lemma_4; @(posedge clk) disable iff (rst) (c >= 0 && c <= 23); endproperty",
      "explanation": "At c = 23, the x identity gives x = 15, so the loop cannot increment c again. Together, these lemmas are 1-inductive: DONE implies x >= 0; within the bounded counter range, that requires c = 23, hence y = 17 > 0."
